<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak government approves SKK 1.0 bln bond issue.</title>
<headline>Slovak government approves SKK 1.0 bln bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak government on Tuesday approved a plan to issue a one billion crown tranche of state bonds to boost resources for housing construction, the government said in a statement after a regular cabinet meeting.</p>
<p>The statement gave no further details and it was not clear what form the issue would take.</p>
<p>The bond will be issued by the Finance Ministry, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
